/E (1.2 Problem Statement )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
888 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 550 0 R
/E (Teachers need a convenient way to maintain student details, organise subjects and topics, record assessment results and identify students who may need academic improvement. When these activities are performed manually or across separate files, record management and performance analysis require additional effort, percentages must be calculated repeatedly, and locating students who score below a defined threshold is inconvenient. A simple, centralised application is therefore required to )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
