/T (StudyLens has four entities, each implemented as a Zoho Creator form. A subject contains many topics, and each assessment record links one student with one subject and one topic. Percentage and Performance Status are derived attributes of an assessment. In Zoho Creator, such one-to-many relationships are realised through lookup fields. The relationships in Figure 4.2 and Table 4.1 represent the relational data model of the application. )
