/P 568 0 R
/T (StudyLens is organised into six navigation sections that match its modules \(Figure 4.4a\). The Dashboard is the first section so that the teacher sees the summary on opening the application. The wireframe in Figure 4.4b is the conceptual layout of the dashboard: four summary cards \(Total Students, Total Subjects, Total Topics and Total Assessments\) above a simple chart of assessment marks, using a clean purple-and-white theme. It is a design sketch, not a screenshot of the implemented page. )
/E (StudyLens is organised into six navigation sections that match its modules \(Figure 4.4a\). The Dashboard is the first section so that the teacher sees the summary on opening the application. The wireframe in Figure 4.4b is the conceptual layout of the dashboard: four summary cards \(Total Students, Total Subjects, Total Topics and Total Assessments\) above a simple chart of assessment marks, using a clean purple-and-white theme. It is a design sketch, not a screenshot of the implemented page. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [7]
>>
