1502 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 571 0 R
/E (Assessments form. Records the Student Name, Subject Name, Topic Name, Total Marks and Marks Obtained. A record is accepted only when Total Marks is greater than zero and Marks Obtained is neither negative nor greater than Total Marks. Percentage and Performance Status can be derived either with Formula fields, whose values Zoho Creator calculates automatically when a record is submitted [7], or with a Deluge script on the validation event of the form \(Section 5.5\). In StudyLens, Deluge form workflow scripts \(DS-01 and DS-02\) on the On Validate event are used so that invalid marks are rejected before percentage calculation and status assignment occur. )
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
