/T (No integration has been implemented in the current version of StudyLens. The application does not connect to any other Zoho service or external system, does not call any REST API and does not expose a webhook. All data are entered and stored within the Zoho Creator application itself. This keeps the project focused on forms, reports and the dashboard. Possible future integrations, such as email notifications for low scores, are listed in Section 9.2. )
/E (No integration has been implemented in the current version of StudyLens. The application does not connect to any other Zoho service or external system, does not call any REST API and does not expose a webhook. All data are entered and stored within the Zoho Creator application itself. This keeps the project focused on forms, reports and the dashboard. Possible future integrations, such as email notifications for low scores, are listed in Section 9.2. )
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [58]
>>
