1729 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 578 0 R
/E (StudyLens does not use Zia or any other AI feature of Zoho Creator, and no machine learning model has been trained or used. The learning gap analysis is a transparent, rule-based classification of the assessment percentage against a 50% threshold. All forms, reports, Deluge validation scripts and dashboard components were configured and verified manually by the developer without using AI-generated code. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1730 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 578 0 R
/E (Analytics in StudyLens are limited to descriptive summaries: the record totals and the assessment marks chart on the Dashboard, and the Percentage and Performance Status columns of the Learning Gap Analysis report. These summaries help the teacher see the overall picture but depend entirely on the accuracy and completeness of the entered records. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
