1920 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 584 0 R
/T (During initial testing of the Assessments form, two defects were identified and resolved using Deluge alert messages and boundary test inputs. First \(BUG-01\), entering Total Marks as 0 without a pre-calculation guard caused a division-by-zero runtime error when computing the percentage; this was resolved by placing the DS-01 check \(input.Total_Marks == null || input.Total_Marks <= 0\) with cancel submit before the division statement. Second \(BUG-02\), integer division truncated fractional percentages before rounding; multiplying Marks_Obtained by 100.0 \(floating-point literal\) prior to dividing by Total_Marks and applying .round\(2\) ensured accurate two-decimal percentages. Both defects are recorded in Table 6.2. )
/E (During initial testing of the Assessments form, two defects were identified and resolved using Deluge alert messages and boundary test inputs. First \(BUG-01\), entering Total Marks as 0 without a pre-calculation guard caused a division-by-zero runtime error when computing the percentage; this was resolved by placing the DS-01 check \(input.Total_Marks == null || input.Total_Marks <= 0\) with cancel submit before the division statement. Second \(BUG-02\), integer division truncated fractional percentages before rounding; multiplying Marks_Obtained by 100.0 \(floating-point literal\) prior to dividing by Total_Marks and applying .round\(2\) ensured accurate two-decimal percentages. Both defects are recorded in Table 6.2. )
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
