/T (Zoho Creator supports separate Development, Stage and Production environments in its supported plans, allowing changes to be tested before they are published to users. The availability of these environments depends on the Zoho Creator edition being used. For StudyLens, application development, testing and verification were carried out in the primary Zoho Creator Development environment under the developer's account in October 2026. Because the application is intended for a single teacher \(the application owner\), it is accessed directly within the authenticated Zoho Creator workspace without requiring separate multi-stage enterprise environment promotion. )
