/Title (The sources reviewed fall into two groups. The first group consists of studies of low- code development platforms [1], [3], [4] and the official Zoho Creator documentation, which inform how StudyLens is built. The second group consists of educational research on classroom assessment [5] and learning analytics [6], which provides general background on why recorded assessment results are worth analysing. Table 2.2 summarises these sources. The educational sources are background only: StudyLens implements a simple percentage-threshold rule and does not implement the methods discussed in them.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5078 0 R
