<<
/Title (Data layer. Submitted records are stored in the built-in database of the Zoho Creator application, one record set per form \(Students, Subjects, Topics and Assessments\). The reports, the Learning Gap Analysis and the dashboard read these stored records. No external database or integration is used.)
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5223 0 R
/Prev 5239 0 R
>>
