5233 0 obj
<<
/Title (Governance of StudyLens is kept simple because it is a single-owner academic application. Consistent naming is used for forms and fields \(for example, Student_Name, Total_Marks, Marks_Obtained\), which makes the data model and any scripts easier to read. The application owner is responsible for maintaining the forms, correcting data-entry mistakes and keeping the sample data separate from any real data. Advanced enterprise administration features such as automated audit trails and scheduled cloud backups were not required for this small-scale academic project; standard Zoho Creator application settings and manual CSV/spreadsheet export from list reports are used when record backups are needed.)
/Dest [60 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5224 0 R
>>
endobj
