5264 0 obj
<<
/Title (StudyLens stores a small, class-sized data set, so performance was not a major concern and no measurements were taken. The following good practices were nevertheless followed in the design: each form contains only the fields that are needed; the designed scripts operate only on the submitted record and do not fetch other records inside loops; and the Learning Gap Analysis shows only the columns needed for review. Table 7.2 lists these practices; before-and-after values are not reported because they were not measured.)
/Dest [59 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5256 0 R
>>
endobj
